As far as I'm concerned, the more languages Lojban training texts are in,
the better. Currently, Lojban is a very English-centric language, which
means the vast majority, if not the entirety, of the Lojban community is
either English native (the language, not the country), such as myself, or
has learned English, such as you and .xorxes.

